@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+---
+id: task-005-add-booking-cancellation
+type: task
+title: "Add booking cancellation"
+status: approved
+format: 1
+---
+
+Add `cancel(bookingId, at)` to the rental service. It cancels an existing booking at the supplied
+UTC timestamp and returns `{ bookingId, refund }` in euro cents. Refund the full booking total when
+the cancellation is at least 24 hours before its start; otherwise refund zero. A cancelled booking
+must no longer reserve its equipment, and a booking can only be cancelled once. Document the API
+and cancellation policy.
